      "text": "IN PHOTOS: Health workers of public hospitals in the National Capital Region (NCR), Baguio and Bacolod marched together in a protest in Mendiola, Manila to highlight the ongoing struggle they are facing in their respective hospitals and health facilities nationwide.\n\nThey are united in their calls for a livable wage, job security, the timely release of loan benefits, and free health services for people, amid a worsening economic and health crisis affecting both health workers and the public, alongside National Health Workers Day 2026. \n\n📸 Norman Cruz",
